  "body": "MAINLINE-051 PARTIAL / HELD; assignment incomplete. QUESTIONABLE / PROJECTION.\n\nCompleted the 750-member target surface: all integer m=5–40, Pf=1e-3/1e-6, both reserves, operating and own-screen loads, actual lengths, coupon and 3 m references. All 592 arithmetic checks pass across 288 rows.\n\nAt m10, own-screen complete-member scales needed for Pf1e-3 are 4.278678/4.209090 GPa; Pf1e-6 needs 8.537512/8.398658 GPa. Corresponding 1 cm³ coupon scales for Pf1e-3 are 9.088382/8.907641 GPa. The hypothetical whole-member 3.9 GPa/m10 model already meets Pf1e-3 at q=1 (0.000643916/0.000947308), not at the higher own screens.\n\nReviewed primary evidence for 14 construction families. Fibre tension, bundle/flexure/hoop statistics and compression averages remain separate. No complete-tube compression distribution or evidence-backed winner is established. Current M55J/T700S composite compression averages are 890/1450 MPa, not member allowables.\n\nFrame comparison admission was refused before start: memory PSI some avg10=5.64 >=5.00, exit75. No retry or alternative numerical launch. Candidate masses/SFs, numerical material gaps, 041 hail probabilities and cascade recalculations remain unfinished/null; drafts are explicitly unexecuted. One earlier target job completed and released.\n\n045's hail and deleted-member results use the older section; static stress amplification does not establish dynamic cascade. Fifteen NFIs retain missing work and evidence. All 66 pinned copies and 129 package files verify; live COMMON.md drift is disclosed. Closing this attempt as held, not declaring work done. No successor; SLEEPING.",
